9. PROGRESSION & ECONOMY
========================================

9.1 RUN STRUCTURE
-----------------
- 7 Levels, each with 5-7 nodes before Level Boss
- Total encounters per run: ~35-45 nodes
- Node Types:
  * Skirmish (Standard combat)
  * Elite Battle (Harder, better rewards)
  * Event (Text-based, use dice pool for choices)
  * Rest Site (Heal Leader OR Upgrade card OR Transform Diamond)
  * Shop (Buy cards/relics/services)
  * Boss (End of each level)

9.2 GOLD INCOME
---------------
Combat Rewards:
- Basic Skirmish: 5-7 Gold (avg 6)
- Elite Battle: 10-15 Gold (avg 12)
- Level Boss: 20-30 Gold (avg 25)
- Superboss Victory: 100 Gold

Alternative Income:
- Skip Draft: 8 Gold
- Event Success: 5-15 Gold
- Event Failure: 0-3 Gold

Expected Total Per Run: 350-450 Gold

