11. GLOSSARY
========================================

COMBAT KEYWORDS:
- Armor (X): Reduce all damage by X (min 0)
- Bleed (X): Take X damage when attacking/using abilities
- Burn (X): Take X damage at start of turn, decreases by 1 each turn
- Dodge (X%): X% chance to avoid attack (0 damage)
- Enraged: Attack twice per turn
- Exhaust: Remove from encounter, return at combat end
- Fatigue: Shuffle discard → Remove 1 random card permanently
- Hemophilia/Lifesteal: Heal for 50% damage dealt
- Immunity: Can't be affected by specified type
- Plated: Shield doesn't expire at turn start
- Poison (X): Take X damage at end of turn (doesn't decrease)
- Regeneration (X): Heal X HP at start of turn
- Shield (X): Temp HP, absorbs damage, expires at turn start
- Silence: Lose passives, can't be affected by Support for 1 turn
- Stealth: Can't be targeted by single-target (AOE still hits)
- Stun: Can't attack or use abilities next turn
- Taunt: Enemies must target this unit
- Thorns (X): Melee attackers take X damage
- True Damage: Ignores Shields and Armor

BOARD KEYWORDS:
- Breach: Enemy attacks through empty Vanguard to hit Rearguard/Leader
- Cross-Lane Targeting: Attack adjacent if primary target empty
- Flank (R1/R7): Rearguard positions with no direct Vanguard
- Rotation: Backline enemy moves forward when Frontline dies
- Vanguard/Rearguard: Front row (5 slots) / Back row (7 slots)

CARD TAGS:
- Consumable: Removed after use (Jokers)
- Mechanical: Counts as machine (Iron Emperor synergy)
- Undead: Can't be healed, Immune to Poison
- Cannot Remove: Can't delete from deck via Shop
- Unplayable: Can't play manually, triggered by conditions

TURN PHASES:
- Start of Turn: Roll dice, draw, trigger Regen/Poison
- End of Turn: Trigger Burn, expire shields, cleanup
- On Play: Triggers when played from hand
- On Death: Triggers at 0 HP (not Retired/Exhausted)
- Passive: Always active

META KEYWORDS:
- Renown: Meta currency from runs
- Rank Up: Permanent Leader stat increase
- Veterancy: Starting deck modifications

