12. TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS
========================================

12.1 DICE CONFIGURATIONS
------------------------
Default: 2d6 (Range: 2-12, Avg: 7)
Upgrades (Meta):
- 2d6+1d4: Range 4-16, Avg 9.5
- 3d6: Range 3-18, Avg 10.5
- 5d4: Range 5-20, Avg 12.5 (consistent)
- 1d12+1d6: Range 2-18, Avg 10 (high variance)

12.2 DAMAGE CALCULATIONS
------------------------
Spades Vanguard ATK = Current HP (dynamic)
Spades Rearguard ATK = 2 (ranks 2-5), 4 (6-10), 6 (Ace)
Clubs Vanguard HP = Face Value × 1.5 (rounded up)
Clubs Vanguard ATK = Face Value ÷ 2 (rounded down)
Clubs Thorns = Rank ÷ 2 (rounded down, min 1)
Hearts Vanguard ATK = Face Value ÷ 2 (rounded down)
Hearts Lifesteal = 50% damage dealt (rounded down)
Hearts Overheal = 25% excess healing to Leader

12.3 SUPPORT CALCULATIONS
-------------------------
Clubs Rearguard Shield = Face Value ÷ 2 (rounded down)
Hearts Rearguard Heal = Face Value ÷ 2 (rounded down)

12.4 GAME CONSTANTS
-------------------
Max Hand Size: Unlimited (base), +1 with Commander's Helm
Max Reserve Dice: 2 dice
Starting Hand: 5 cards
Draw Per Turn: 1 card (after Turn 1)
Battle Fatigue Start: Round 15
Breach Priority: Center → Inner Flanks → Outer Flanks

